Package: ispconfig-rest
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Vladimir Berezhnoy <non7top@gmail.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/non7top/ispconfig-rest
Description: REST API for ISPConfig
 A contract-first REST API in front of an ISPConfig 3.3 database; it
 journals every change through sys_datalog and never writes ISPConfig's
 own tables directly.
 .
 The package ships the application with its dependencies built, the
 ispconfig-rest manager, a system user and the /var/log and /var/cache
 directories. It writes no configuration and runs no migration: the
 environment file in /etc/ispconfig-rest, the php-fpm pool and the web
 server are set up by the administrator, then `ispconfig-rest migrate`
 creates the API's own table. A PHP 8.3 or newer command line is needed
 for the manager and is not a declared dependency.
